{
  "message": "That’s wonderful to hear, John—sending to your own number worked. You can go ahead and send the birthday photo to your daughter now.",
  "reminders": [
    "While you’re in France, keep Mobile Data ON and Data Roaming ON for MMS.",
    "If MMS ever fails again, a quick reboot usually helps. If needed, repeat the APN reset and reboot steps."
  ],
  "optional_note": "You can turn Wi‑Fi back ON after sending if you prefer; MMS will still rely on mobile data.",
  "offer_help": "If it doesn’t go through to your daughter or you see any error, tell me what you see and I’ll help right away."
}

